{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>警方拘捕一名男子，涉嫌同昨日大埔金行劫案有關。</p><p></p><p>遇劫的是位於大埔廣福道70號的周生生珠寶金行，賊人昨日下午3時，掠去一條足金頸鏈後，往廣福里方向逃去。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ROBBERY-1800_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20266vr0WUcqrB1792059999.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>警方相隔一日拘捕一個37歲男子，但未起回贓物，正追查金鏈下落。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T13:40:04.820760+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T09:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T13:38:00.317483+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:38:00.317483+00:00","content_hash":"307b4e36fe0635f9fcdabd467cab52ad93acf50807fd42c7b45c2a85ce4c068c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}